Your DB insert is failing because the entity's primary key isn't being generated by JPA/DB (the `id` column is NOT NULL but no value or default is provided). Add a generated id strategy on your entity so Hibernate doesn't try to insert a null id.

Example fix: update the `LiftingExercise` entity to use a generated id (IDENTITY for PostgreSQL serial/bigserial) — or use a sequence if preferred.

